  "label": "Hitler is mapped as nonchalantly killing millions of Jews",
  "description": "The text 'hitler nonchalantly killing millions of jews with no remorse' explicitly maps Adolf Hitler (the visual entity) onto the act of nonchalantly killing millions of Jews. The visual material of Hitler sitting casually on a blanket is juxtaposed with the text to create an analogical mapping where his mundane posture is equated with the horrific act of genocide. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, trivializing the Holocaust by reducing it to a casual, picnic-like scene.",
